<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37944" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπακ-τικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>leading on</i>: </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b> in Logic, <i>inductive,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρότασις, λόγοι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>APo.</u>
				77b35
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Top.</u>
				108b7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				1078b28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1.11S.
			</span></i>
			Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς, σκοπεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					210b8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>conducive,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς εὔνοιαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					4.3
				</span></i>
			; <i>stimulating,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς πότον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.
					2.52d
				</span></i>
			 (
				Sup.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>attractive,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῇ ὀσμῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					1.26
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ τὴν ἡδονήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					4.83
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκρόασις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Vett.Val.
					260.26
				</span></i>
			; of persons, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				250.22
			</span></i>.</div>
